{
  "title": "Look up FDA HCT/P recalls",
  "source": "modules/inventory/recall-lookup",
  "url": "https://help.medipyxis.com/modules/inventory/recall-lookup/",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "inv-rc-01",
      "claim": "Open Recall Lookup at /inventory-management/recall-lookup.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "path: \"/inventory-management/recall-lookup\",",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/user-routes.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present",
          "fixed": true
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "<Inv_RecallLookup />",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/user-routes.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present",
          "fixed": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "inv-rc-02",
      "claim": "Open Recall Lookup from Inventory Management.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "recall",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/InventoryManagement.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present",
          "fixed": true,
          "ignoreCase": true
        }
      ],
      "finding": "No hub tile or link: nothing outside the route table references /inventory-management/recall-lookup. Reach it by URL only.",
      "proposed_text": "Open Recall Lookup at /inventory-management/recall-lookup (there is no menu link).",
      "proposed_checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "path: \"/inventory-management/recall-lookup\",",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/user-routes.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present",
          "fixed": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "inv-rc-03",
      "claim": "You need the vendor_coordinator or admin role.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "\"biller\",",
          "paths": [
            "backend/supabase/functions/inventory-recall-lookup/index.ts"
          ],
          "expect": "absent",
          "fixed": true,
          "note": "the lookup would be limited to vendor_coordinator/admin"
        }
      ],
      "finding": "Allowed roles are INVENTORY_ACCESS (admin, vendor_coordinator, clinical_manager, medical_director, clinician, provider) plus biller, finance_ap, superadmin, customersupport (inventory-recall-lookup/index.ts:41-47; _shared/auth-helpers.ts:307). Results are limited to the caller's facilities.",
      "proposed_text": "Anyone with the Inventory feature can run a recall lookup; results cover only your facilities.",
      "proposed_checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "...ROLE_PERMISSIONS.INVENTORY_ACCESS,",
          "paths": [
            "backend/supabase/functions/inventory-recall-lookup/index.ts"
          ],
          "expect": "present",
          "fixed": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "inv-rc-04",
      "claim": "You can look up by the lot number (or distinct identification code) named in the recall notice.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": ".eq(\"lot_number\", lotNumber)",
          "paths": [
            "backend/supabase/functions/inventory-recall-lookup/index.ts"
          ],
          "expect": "present",
          "fixed": true
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "distinct_identification_code",
          "paths": [
            "backend/supabase/functions/inventory-recall-lookup/index.ts"
          ],
          "expect": "present",
          "fixed": true
        }
      ],
      "finding": "The search matches lot_number only (inventory-recall-lookup/index.ts:81). The distinct identification code is returned in the CSV but cannot be searched.",
      "proposed_text": "Enter the lot number named in the recall notice.",
      "proposed_checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": ".eq(\"lot_number\", lotNumber)",
          "paths": [
            "backend/supabase/functions/inventory-recall-lookup/index.ts"
          ],
          "expect": "present",
          "fixed": true
